msgstr "Video YouTube atau tautan langsung ke file audio atau video."

msgid ""
"A fast model writes a draft while you speak. When you stop, the whole "
"recording is transcribed again with the model of the engine, which is "
"more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Model cepat menulis draf saat Anda berbicara. Saat Anda berhenti, seluruh"
" rekaman ditranskripsi ulang dengan model mesin, yang lebih akurat."

